Smart Room Automation System

This project is an Arduino-based smart room automation system designed and simulated in Tinkercad.

Features
Automatic room light control using PIR motion sensor
Temperature-based fan automation using TMP36 sensor
DC motor used for fan simulation
Real-time sensor monitoring and control logic
Components Used
Arduino UNO
PIR Motion Sensor
TMP36 Temperature Sensor
LED
DC Motor
NPN Transistor
Diode
Resistors
Concepts Learned
Sensor interfacing
Embedded automation
Motor control using transistor
Real-time decision making
Smart home system basics
Simulation Platform

Tinkercad Circuits

